fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"coretracers/leaks.html#tracer-leaks:stack-traces-flags","fragment":"\n\tstack-traces-flags\n\nStack trace collection mode. Controls whether and how stack traces are collected\nfor object allocations and ref/unref operations.\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConstruct Only\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tdisabled\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});